<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 775 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 775 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 775 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    13 weeks	 4.75	    --		   --</p>
<p>    One year	30.25	    --		   --</p>
<p>    Two years     12		 --		   --</p>
<p>    Five years   690		 690		10.00 pct</p>
<p>    15 years	85		  85		10.50 pct</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	  822		 775</p>
<p>($1= 9.2 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
